      "content": "It is a serious scholarly position to argue that the UN remains a vital tool, but this view is often heavily qualified. Proponents argue that the UN provides the only global platform for international law and diplomatic engagement, which is infinitely better than pure anarchy. However, this optimism often ignores the reality that the institution is perpetually hostage to the political will of its most powerful members.",
